1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
东北人炖菜，锅比脸盆还大
In Dongbei, the stew pot's bigger than your face

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
满族先民，篝火架起大铁锅
Manchu ancestors set an iron pot on the fire

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
打的、采的，一锅全炖了
Whatever they caught or picked — all in one pot

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
灶台连火炕，炖菜也暖屋
The stove links to the bed-kang — cooks and heats

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
一锅炖鱼，一锅炖排骨
A pot of fish, a pot of ribs

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
锅边贴一圈玉米饼子
Cornbread patties slapped round the rim

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
下半截泡汤，上半截烤脆
Bottoms soak the broth, tops bake crisp

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
这叫"一锅出"，菜饭一起熟
They call it yi-guo-chu — all done at once

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
咕嘟咕嘟，炖下整个冬天
Bubbling away — a whole winter in one pot

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
一家人围着，就着热气造
The whole family digs in through the steam

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,200
锅越大，越是东北的实在
The bigger the pot, the more Dongbei it is

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,200
炖鱼还是炖排骨？你选哪锅
Fish pot or rib pot — which do you pick?

13
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,300
下集：一道菜，馋死野狼嚎
Next: a dish that makes wolves howl with hunger
